                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "9e4200d4-a57c-3de9-946f-a9914850d19f",
                        "entry_id": "5f1f7eb4-6abf-3429-80c3-3438c6c0c904",
                        "glosses": [
                            "советск., разг. сокр. слов местный комитет (профсоюзной организации)"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "abbreviation"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "e79a0eb8-d693-454a-9780-7010b6406e80",
                                "sense_id": "9e4200d4-a57c-3de9-946f-a9914850d19f",
                                "text": "В 3 ч. в Музее состоялось заседание для выборов в местный комитет (местком) .."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "b52faec9-3112-4dc6-9341-16aafe76e5a1",
                                "sense_id": "9e4200d4-a57c-3de9-946f-a9914850d19f",
                                "text": ".. через местком путёвки в санаторий добудет и, между прочим, ей удалось устроить Нюсю в ведомственный детский сад, хотя вот так, с улицы, там никакого не принимали."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "0ddb7913-ac81-3414-b0a1-558fa0f7c419",
                        "entry_id": "5f1f7eb4-6abf-3429-80c3-3438c6c0c904",
                        "glosses": [
                            "советск., разг. место размещения такого комитета"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "52dacf6f-31f5-4629-8640-a558a3d37846",
                                "sense_id": "0ddb7913-ac81-3414-b0a1-558fa0f7c419",
                                "text": "Зайти в местком."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "6270e870-4595-32bd-a719-ad7b96184640",
                        "entry_id": "5f1f7eb4-6abf-3429-80c3-3438c6c0c904",
                        "glosses": [
                            "советск., разг. заседание такого комитета"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "02d5e35c-4e03-4658-866b-21dc38560eb8",
                                "sense_id": "6270e870-4595-32bd-a719-ad7b96184640",
                                "text": "Вынести обсуждение на местком."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "b42ae17f-03b6-4f2b-ac21-49939fb23c8b",
                        "source_entry_id": "5f1f7eb4-6abf-3429-80c3-3438c6c0c904",
                        "source_sense_description": "местный комитет (профсоюзной организации)",
                        "target_lang_word": "local",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "local",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0d2da3fc-aac3-3905-a435-cedfa3604460",
                                        "entry_id": "688f25f1-db61-3d72-ab1c-94f73b7a41c2",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "From or in a nearby location."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7e430a9a-cf9c-411f-a765-9c9c8a5d20d2",
                                                "sense_id": "0d2da3fc-aac3-3905-a435-cedfa3604460",
                                                "text": "We prefer local produce."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7655a0ea-d78a-4711-aca0-0e1ac7db0f75",
                                                "sense_id": "0d2da3fc-aac3-3905-a435-cedfa3604460",
                                                "text": "Not unnaturally, “Auntie” took this communication in bad part.[…]Next day she[…]tried to recover her ward by the hair of the head. Then, thwarted, the wretched creature went to the police for help; she was versed in the law, and perhaps had spared no pains to keep on good terms with the local constabulary."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ad3b5102-127a-4035-b34e-6d27575794cc",
                                                "sense_id": "0d2da3fc-aac3-3905-a435-cedfa3604460",
                                                "text": "A farmer could place an order for a new tractor part by text message and pay for it by mobile money-transfer. A supplier many miles away would then take the part to the local matternet station for airborne dispatch via drone."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "aed7d1c4-e079-36f0-8636-6aeb1a068cdf",
                                        "entry_id": "688f25f1-db61-3d72-ab1c-94f73b7a41c2",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Connected directly to a particular computer, processor, etc.; able to be accessed offline."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "of a resource"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ce111b71-0a82-47e9-8f29-23efe4dfacc6",
                                                "sense_id": "aed7d1c4-e079-36f0-8636-6aeb1a068cdf",
                                                "text": "local disk drive"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "50764dd0-e578-4bf4-a203-31eb24bc61b2",
                                                "sense_id": "aed7d1c4-e079-36f0-8636-6aeb1a068cdf",
                                                "text": "local file"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7fe1a46c-3d5b-4c81-b6f7-a3bd8e59d23c",
                                                "sense_id": "aed7d1c4-e079-36f0-8636-6aeb1a068cdf",
                                                "text": "The panel shows both local and remote sites."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c6397e4b-a9f2-32b9-a1fa-27a8786efc20",
                                        "entry_id": "688f25f1-db61-3d72-ab1c-94f73b7a41c2",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Having limited scope (either lexical or dynamic); only accessible within a certain portion of a program."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "of a variable or identifier"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "02f6789c-d9fd-3a27-83e9-f12c1283b6a2",
                                        "entry_id": "688f25f1-db61-3d72-ab1c-94f73b7a41c2",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Applying to or satisfied by substructures understood as \\\"near points;\\\" in particular:",
                                            "Satisfied by at least one open neighborhood of every point."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ed4ae9fb-1ddf-45d2-9459-3f1858f87ab9",
                                                "sense_id": "02f6789c-d9fd-3a27-83e9-f12c1283b6a2",
                                                "text": "A Hausdorff space satisfying local compactness need not be (globally) compact!"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "729e14e9-e484-3bd0-9f97-3ead0ea0670f",
                                        "entry_id": "688f25f1-db61-3d72-ab1c-94f73b7a41c2",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Applying to or satisfied by substructures understood as \\\"near points;\\\" in particular:",
                                            "Satisfied by arbitrarily small open neighborhoods of every point."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b0322f09-2587-3324-a41c-86bc2f56fba3",
                                        "entry_id": "688f25f1-db61-3d72-ab1c-94f73b7a41c2",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Applying to or satisfied by substructures understood as \\\"near points;\\\" in particular:",
                                            "Satisfied by every finitely generated subgroup."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d1d798b5-d4d3-3084-8884-d684011978dc",
                                        "entry_id": "688f25f1-db61-3d72-ab1c-94f73b7a41c2",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Detectable from the behavior of substructures understood to be \\\"near points;\\\" in particular:",
                                            "Such that the following conditions are equivalent: (1) P holds for R (M); (2) P holds for the localization R_p (M_p) for all prime ideals p of R; (3) P holds for the localization R_m (M_m) for all maximal ideals m of R."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "583052bd-3f81-4457-b96e-76912f42a771",
                                                "sense_id": "d1d798b5-d4d3-3084-8884-d684011978dc",
                                                "text": "Flatness is a local property."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "af20f714-afe9-3e61-8e43-73e37e6c8c4a",
